# Build-context hygiene (2026-08-21). Every Dockerfile COPY/ADD in this repo
# sources only docker/ and working/ (audited across all six Dockerfiles that
# session); the repo carries ~6 GB — corpus, an extracted engine tree, probe
# media — that no build uses, and without this file `docker build .` tars all
# of it into the daemon per build. Nothing here is referenced by any COPY.
.git
corpus/
engine/
working/results/
working/video/results/
working/video/probe/media/
**/__pycache__/
*.avi
benchmark-A.backup*/
reference*/
